<urn:repronim:abide:abstract/ohbm2026/25/claim/10> a ex:AbstractClaim ;
    rdfs:label "Based on whole-brain hb rsFC of participants, we employed agglomerative hierarchical clustering to negate cluster quantity a priori, supported by Euclidean distance and Ward’s linkage method." ;
