<urn:repronim:abide:abstract/ohbm2026/2636/claim/2> a ex:AbstractClaim ;
    rdfs:label "Most resting-state fMRI studies analyze isolated metrics or single network levels, limiting understanding of how voxel-wise, seed-based, and systems-level connectivity jointly characterize typical maturation." ;
